WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 13</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.470
<i>Where's that ring Mochi was talking about?</i>

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.870
<i>Maybe... in the bedroom?</i>

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.460
<i>Maybe under the bedding?</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.540
What are you doing, dear wife?

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.110
Since you are so interested in my bed, 
why are you pushing me away?

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:22.600
Will you not regret that?

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.970
Huh? What nonsense is this?

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:28.100
Y-You... Move out of my way!

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.560
Move out of your way?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.970
What if I say no?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:35.510
Dear wife...

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.970
What were you looking for in here?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:41.840
Looking for?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:47.810
N-Nothing! I just can't stand it being 
such a mess, so I tidied up a bit.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:52.190
In that case, you can keep 
this room tidy from now on.

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.750
<i>Rats, I dug a hole for myself there.</i>

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.560
Dear wife, you are the 
best person for this task.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.180
Limbering up so early in the morning? 
It is good to see you are so excited.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:09.680
What is it?

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:14.430
Breakfast is ready, and I am 
here to escort Your Highnesses.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.430
A meal waiting for us?

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.190
This looks delicious!

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:23.440
<i>It's paradise on my tongue!</i>

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.560
You... realize these are ordinary dishes, yes?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.160
What do <i>you</i> know?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.880
Delicious food is like an elixir,

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.650
which does not only lift
a bad mood, but can also...

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.350
...make you gain weight.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.420
<i>You're</i> gaining weight. 
Everyone in your palace is.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.020
<i>Why do I find her charming?</i>

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.020
What are you smiling at?

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.360
This is the first time you 
did not disagree with me.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.770
I am simply taken aback.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.890
Disagree with you? Have I?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.380
<i>I can't see it anywhere.</i>

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.610
<i>I should check if he has it on his person.</i>

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.060
<i>Hey, I know how!</i>

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.810
<i>What is this woman up to?</i>

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.810
Please, have some tea, Highness.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.810
It is rare for my dear wife 
to be so considerate.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:40.690
<i>No rings on his fingers.</i>

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:55.600
Oh no! Oh <i>no</i>! Your Highness, 
don't move. I'll help you wipe it up.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.140
Oh my, Your Highness. Why didn't you dodge it?

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.030
<i>It's not on him, either.</i>

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>Seems he isn't who Mochi's after. 
I should clear out now.</i>

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.150
Your Highness, I will go do some cleaning.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.070
I won't disturb your reading.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.750
You fool around and then leave?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.830
What are you doing?!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.120
Let me go!

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.920
And if I do not?

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.850
If you don't, I'll use my Ultimate Move on you!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.180
<i>Is she gloating?</i>

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.680
<i>This is the first time I have seen her cry.</i>

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.080
Do not cry.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.050
My lady, you have returned!

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.560
My lady?

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.890
I'm fine. I'm just exhausted 
and want to sleep...

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.080
<i>What is this?</i>

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.270
So he really didn't have that ring on him?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.350
Yeah, I told you.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.900
I searched everywhere, 
top to bottom, inside and out.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:04.890
Inside... of him?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:09.360
A-Anyway, I'm sure he doesn't have it!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.520
Why has she not come today?

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.650
Your Highness, Her Highness said 
she was not feeling well today,

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.270
so she could not come attend to you.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:25.270
She is ill? Has a doctor been called?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.520
Her Highness does not wish to see a doctor.
She said a few days' rest is what she needs.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:37.710
Go give the princess the health tonic and
snacks His Imperial Majesty sent as a gift.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.270
Yes, Your Highness.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.220
She is ill...

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:05.520
What did you do on Spirit Cloud 
Mountain when it rained, my lady?

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.020
On rainy days, I'd hunt for 
treasure inside the mountain.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:11.520
Treasure?

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:17.140
I know, Que'er! Let's go 
hunt for treasure together!

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:20.920
What kind of treasure is Mistress 
Yunxi hunting for? I want to join in, too!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.140
All right, you're in!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.190
You guys go. I need sleep.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.890
As expected from Master Mochi, 
who does not care for treasure.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.020
Treasure?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.390
Sesame, look. My treasure.

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.860
Wood ear fungus?

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.520
Que'er, catch!

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.040
I will, but please be careful.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.090
Your Highness?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.520
That should be enough. Let's go, Sesame.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.170
Sesame?

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.340
Wait... if he's in that state...

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:11.940
G-Greetings, Your Highness.
Long may you live.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.080
It's you...

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:20.140
My lady!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.620
I still have things to do. I'm off.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:44.850
Please do it yourself.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.630
Wait.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.060
What is it?

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:51.180
Come dry me off.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.060
I refuse.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:57.180
You cannot. I am soaked
 through because of you.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:01.140
You did that to yourself! Suffer the 
consequences of your own actions.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.560
Then, answer my question: 
what were you doing up there?

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:06.520
Didn't you see? I was picking wood ear fungus.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.970
Are you not ill? Were you lying to me?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:17.410
I <i>was</i> ill, b-but I felt better, so I went 
out to pick some wood ear fungus...

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:21.390
Since you are feeling better, 
you can continue serving me.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.180
Dry me off.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.180
Oh, fine. But I need to grab something first.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.560
I want you to dry me with your hands!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.260
You should be happy I'm helping 
you at all! Stop asking for more!

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.030
Go get someone else to do it!

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:54.350
Do you find me so repulsive?

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.090
What do <i>you</i> think?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:58.600
You think you're a magnet 
that can just attract anyone?

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.510
You enjoy tormenting me.
It's annoying as hell.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:03.680
I'm leaving.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.750
<i>Annoying?</i>

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:16.350
You say you do not like me, but you married 
me and became my princess, did you not?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.020
It's not just my head saying it. 
My body doesn't like you, either.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.810
And I didn't exactly have a choice.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.320
Do you really think I wanted to marry—

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.140
What are you doing?!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.900
This is what you get for irritating me.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.100
Can you not feel what I am doing?

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.570
Then, I shall do it again!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:35.180
You—

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.510
Are you crazy?!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.720
How dare you...

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.210
Why? Why are you doing this to me?

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.530
We can both keep our 
distance from each other!

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:54.310
Why must you keep messing with me?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.710
Weren't we both happy before,
living in our separate bubbles?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:01.620
Since you and I are so tired of 
each other, let's just stay apart!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.600
So please don't bother me anymore!

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.840
Keep our distance from each other?

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.470
Wishful thinking.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:22.720
Your Highness?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.430
So please don't bother me anymore!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:54.520
It's best if we don't see each other again!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.030
<i>Damn...</i>

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:09.520
Your Highness, I have discovered 
the true identity of the princess.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.020
Tell me.

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:16.240
I discovered Qian Yunshang is the 
Grand Councilor's <i>second</i> daughter.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:18.430
The emperor arranged for her to marry you.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.930
However, the woman who became 
your princess is Qian Yunxi,

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.860
considered a jinx since childhood 
and raised on Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.550
Excellent.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.030
The Grand Councilor will rue his deception.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:32.630
You may leave.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.020
Yes, Highness.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:39.390
<i>So your name is... Qian Yunxi.</i>

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:48.270
This is wasabi.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.940
Don't use too much or your 
tongue won't thank you for it.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.520
I have never tried it before.

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.550
Then, you're about to have 
an unforgettable experience.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.040
Fair maiden!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.720
Are you here?

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.520
Who's there?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.850
I have finally found you! 
I am glad I did not give up!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:06.850
Stay away!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.350
Do not be shy!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.970
What are you doing here?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:26.100
What are these?

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.100
Wood ear fungus I picked.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.210
Give it a try.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:34.700
My nose!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.350
My nose!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.850
<i>Yu Zimo...</i>

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:43.970
How can such a special 
flavor exist in this world?

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.970
I didn't expect your hobby 
to be so special, either.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:50.840
Out of interest, why do you reside here?

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.620
I hear tell that this is a haunted, 
inauspicious place. Does that not scare you?

00:14:57.010 --> 00:15:01.010
No, only people with skeletons in 
the closet are scared of ghosts.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:02.600
I quite like it here.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.690
Even if you are not scared,

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:08.270
it is mightily unfair for a 
princess to be residing here.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.030
Ye Youming, that jerk!

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.850
How can he treat a frail girl in this way?

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.760
Come with me. You need not 
be subjected to this abuse.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.270
You dare to abduct my princess?

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.890
How very courageous of you.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.280
How can you let the princess 
reside in a place like this?

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.900
Is it not improper?

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:33.890
I feel no compunction to discuss with you 
where I wish my princess to reside.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:38.140
I do not care how you feel!
It is my business if you mistreat her!

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:39.930
Is it indeed?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.520
It seems that you still have 
not realized that she is your...

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.270
...<i>sister-in-law</i>.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:46.640
In-Law

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:46.680
In-Law

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:46.720
Sister-

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:46.770
Sister-

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:46.810
Sister-

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:46.810
In-Law

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:46.850
Sister-

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:46.850
In-Law

